Package: LDblockR
Type: Package
Title: Linkage Disequilibrium Blocks, Regional Association Tracks, and Haplotype Tools
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaofeng", "Song", email = "songxiaofeng109@163.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Pengyu", "Chen", email = "15803747006@163.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Fei", "Liang", email = "fyliangfei@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Xiaofeng Song [aut], Pengyu Chen [aut], Fei Liang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Fei Liang <fyliangfei@163.com>
Description: Reads regional genotype data from VCF, HapMap, PLINK, or numeric
    matrices; calculates pairwise r-squared and Lewontin's D-prime; detects
    haplotype blocks; selects tag variants; summarizes LD decay and haplotype
    frequencies; fits a fast GAPIT-principle mixed linear model GWAS with
    marker-level and model-level PVE; and draws publication-ready Manhattan,
    Q-Q, and LD heatmap figures aligned with association statistics, gene
    models, blocks, tag SNPs, and highlighted variants. A one-call workflow
    and a command-line interface are included.
